nt_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.stable\n- Not reproducible in: 4.6.stable\n\nThis appears to be a regression introduced between 4.6 and 4.7.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700 (20 threads) - 31.74 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using RichTextLabel with BBCode enabled, nesting [p] inside [font_size] inserts an unexpected empty line before the first paragraph.\n\nExpected behavior: the text should render on the first line.\n\nActual behavior: an empty line is inserted before the text.\n\nThis only happens when [p] is nested inside [font_size].\n\nThe following works correctly:\n\n[p][font_size=22]aaa[/font_size][/p]\n\nThe following inserts an empty first line:\n\n[font_size=22][p]aaa[/p][/font_size]\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new project.\nAdd a RichTextLabel.\nEnable BBCode.\nSet the text to:\n[font_size=22][p]aaa[/p][/font_size]\nRun the scene.\n\nResult: an empty first line appears before aaa.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n> **Bugsquad edit**: attached MRP\n\n[repro_2026-07-05_11-43-19.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29672657/repro_2026-07-05_11-43-19.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starre